## Categories seeded in cataloger

Canonical list: **CategorySeeder** (`.tools/Bible.Alarm.Cataloger/Seeders/CategorySeeder.cs`) seeds category codes only; display names are in shared project JSON (`Resources/CategoryNames/E.json`). **JwSourceHelper** (`src/Bible.Alarm.Shared/Helpers/JwSourceHelper.cs`) maps category → publication codes; **PublicationTypeHelper** (`src/Bible.Alarm.Shared/Helpers/PublicationTypeHelper.cs`) drives catalog type and section structure.

**Publication lists**: The single source of truth for which publications we fetch is **JwSourceHelper**. The **Drama cataloger** iterates **JwSourceHelper.AllMediatorPublicationCodes** (all mediator categories). **Video cataloger** iterates **VideoPublicationCodes** and **SeriesPublicationCodes** (flat/index-service API). Bible and Music catalogers use **BiblePublicationCodes**, **VocalMusicPublicationCodes**, **MelodyMusicPublicationCodes**. Before Phase 2, the cataloger runs **CatalogValidator.ValidateMediatorLinksAsync** (GET each `/categories/E/{code}`, assert `category.media` array); failure exits with code 1.

Base URL for GETPUBMEDIALINKS: `https://b.jw-cdn.org/apis/pub-media/GETPUBMEDIALINKS`. Mediator discovery: `https://app.jw-cdn.org/apis/mediator/v1/categories/{lang}/{categoryKey}`.

